                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "84c00745-5975-39d9-ba02-3a5dbc94e073",
                        "entry_id": "e84f8821-b214-3934-a69a-71eb42ea4c84",
                        "glosses": [
                            "diminutive of суп (sup)"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "diminutive",
                            "form-of"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "b1a5abcf-0e31-45aa-b0a7-79a105eaec1b",
                                "sense_id": "84c00745-5975-39d9-ba02-3a5dbc94e073",
                                "text": "Лежу на столе, а доктор мне показывает подосиновик с голову человечью, весь в кровище моей перепачканный, и такой же боровик: ну что, дура, вырастила ты себе в животе дедушкину грибницу? Приглашай на грибной супец!",
                                "translation": "I’m lyin’ on a table an’ the doc shows me a Boletus with a head that’s all human like an’ soiled in my blood, plus a penny bun that’s just as big: Well, ye little idiot, the doc says, ye wanted to grow Gramps’s Mushrooms in yer stomach? Ye can invite me over for some mushroom soup, then!",
                                "english": "I’m lyin’ on a table an’ the doc shows me a Boletus with a head that’s all human like an’ soiled in my blood, plus a penny bun that’s just as big: Well, ye little idiot, the doc says, ye wanted to grow Gramps’s Mushrooms in yer stomach? Ye can invite me over for some mushroom soup, then!"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
